<title>UK: UK's Major to hold regular news conference Friday.</title>
<headline>UK's Major to hold regular news conference Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister John Major will hold a news conference on Friday at 1030 GMT, the ruling Conservative party said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Party officials said the conference was one of a series that Major would be holding in the run-up to Britain's general election, which must be held by May 22.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom 44-171-542 7767</p>
